[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":276},["ShallowReactive",2],{"911g0E8GchOGEEt_0aujMQusuxZSSuUQITQs47oJnLk":3},{"seo":4,"slug":8,"isDarkTheme":9,"heroBackgroundColour":10,"highlightColour":12,"simpleTitle":14,"excerpt":15,"hero":16,"heroAsset":31,"location":44,"sector":45,"services":52,"introCopy":53,"storyblockAccordions":54,"storyblockAssets":64,"flexibleContent":97,"footerLinkLabel":268,"footerLinks":269},{"title":5,"description":6,"image":7},"William & Sons","William & Son of Mayfair embodies Royal Warrant luxury—a distinctly British retail design, crafted by seventh-generation Asprey heritage.",null,"william-sons",false,{"hex":11},"#4A4F5F",{"hex":13},"#FFEEB8","William & Son","An interior befitting the craftsmanship of exquisitely made product",{"title":17,"subtitle":18},"\u003Cp>William\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&amp; Son\u003C/p>",{"value":19,"links":30},{"schema":20,"document":21},"dast",{"type":22,"children":23},"root",[24],{"type":25,"children":26},"paragraph",[27],{"type":28,"value":29},"span","An interior befitting the craftsmanship of exquisitely made product\n",[],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":32,"videoUrl":33,"videoWidth":34,"image":35},900,"",1600,{"width":36,"height":37,"url":38,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":39},3200,1778,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341899-shed_ws_1234-2.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":40,"srcSet":41,"src":42,"width":36,"height":37,"sizes":43},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341899-shed_ws_1234-2.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341899-shed_ws_1234-2.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341899-shed_ws_1234-2.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341899-shed_ws_1234-2.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341899-shed_ws_1234-2.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341899-shed_ws_1234-2.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341899-shed_ws_1234-2.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341899-shed_ws_1234-2.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341899-shed_ws_1234-2.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200","(max-width: 3200px) 100vw, 3200px","Mayfair, London",[46,49],{"slug":47,"label":48},"retail","Retail",{"slug":50,"label":51},"heritage","Heritage","Architecture, Interior Design, FF&E","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiNkNjcFhIbkw1SVl6bzNyemkxekVEdyIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE0MDE1MTE0MDQsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>A truly diverse spectrum of Royal Warrent luxury, William &amp; Son of Mayfair is a distinctively British take on the finest things in life and no surprise when you remember William Asprey is a seventh generation Asprey.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[55,58,61],{"title":56,"copy":57},"The Challenge","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>After working with William Asprey on the Mount Street store, Shed was asked to create a new retail flagship for William &amp; Son. An extension of the product it houses, quirky in places, luxurious with an appreciation for detail.\u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>A modern Great British emporium of luxury.\u2028\u2028\u2028\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":59,"copy":60},"The Strategy","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Bring calm and order to the sometimes idiosyncratic taste and personality of the owner. Always let the exquisite products breathe and let the design reflect these qualities whilst bringing order. In many respects, the approach was reminiscent of a 1930&rsquo;s deco emporium born in an era of grandeur coupled with a subtle sense of humour.\u2028\u2028\u2028\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":62,"copy":63},"The Solution","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>An interior design and architectural scheme reflecting the true spirit of William &amp; Son, always distinct, crafted beautifully and uniquely British.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[65,75,85],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":32,"videoUrl":33,"videoWidth":34,"image":66},{"width":67,"height":68,"url":69,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":70},2094,1176,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342124-shed_ws_1507_0681-2.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":71,"srcSet":72,"src":73,"width":67,"height":68,"sizes":74},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342124-shed_ws_1507_0681-2.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342124-shed_ws_1507_0681-2.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342124-shed_ws_1507_0681-2.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1570w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342124-shed_ws_1507_0681-2.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 2094w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342124-shed_ws_1507_0681-2.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342124-shed_ws_1507_0681-2.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342124-shed_ws_1507_0681-2.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=2094 1570w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342124-shed_ws_1507_0681-2.jpg?fit=crop&w=2094 2094w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342124-shed_ws_1507_0681-2.jpg?fit=crop&w=2094","(max-width: 2094px) 100vw, 2094px",{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":32,"videoUrl":33,"videoWidth":34,"image":76},{"width":77,"height":78,"url":79,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":80},1032,682,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342137-shed_ws_58.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":81,"srcSet":82,"src":83,"width":67,"height":84,"sizes":74},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342137-shed_ws_58.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 523w