=1600 1200w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342274-shed_ws_1112-edit-1.jpg?fit=crop&w=1600 1600w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342274-shed_ws_1112-edit-1.jpg?fit=crop&w=1600",2030,{"_modelApiKey":126,"asset":127},"module_fullwidth",{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":32,"videoUrl":33,"videoWidth":34,"image":128},{"width":129,"height":130,"url":131,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":132},3150,1772,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342306-shed_ws_0776-1.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":133,"srcSet":134,"src":135,"width":36,"height":136,"sizes":43},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342306-shed_ws_0776-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342306-shed_ws_0776-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342306-shed_ws_0776-1.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342306-shed_ws_0776-1.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342306-shed_ws_0776-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342306-shed_ws_0776-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342306-shed_ws_0776-1.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342306-shed_ws_0776-1.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342306-shed_ws_0776-1.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200",1800,{"_modelApiKey":138,"title":139,"sideCopy":140,"mainCopy":141},"module_title_copy","MODERN BRITISH HERITAGE","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>All aspects of the scheme reflected the true spirit of William &amp; Son, always distinct, crafted and uniquely British.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>On entering, a grand bespoke staircase rises up. Shed designed bespoke terrazzo treads with &lsquo;backgammon&rsquo; motifs edging balustrades. This grand statement wraps around a three-metre high, walnut cabinetry, showcasing a glossary of objet d&rsquo;art on offer.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"_modelApiKey":143,"isReversed4060":9,"assets":144},"module_side_by_side_asym",[145,159],{"copy":146,"asset":147},"A ‘retained facade’, new build interior space of 15,000 sqf and a heritage barn conversion presented several building types to design within. Each presenting their own challenges in setting out, sevices and clash detection. ",{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":32,"videoUrl":33,"videoWidth":34,"image":148},{"width":149,"height":150,"url":151,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":152},1740,2208,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342410-shed_ws_60.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":153,"srcSet":154,"src":155,"width":156,"height":157,"sizes":158},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342410-shed_ws_60.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2000 500w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342410-shed_ws_60.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2000 1000w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342410-shed_ws_60.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2000 1500w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342410-shed_ws_60.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2000 2000w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342410-shed_ws_60.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=2000 500w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342410-shed_ws_60.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=2000 1000w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342410-shed_ws_60.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=2000 1500w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342410-shed_ws_60.jpg?fit=crop&w=2000 2000w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342410-shed_ws_60.jpg?fit=crop&w=2000",2000,2538,"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px",{"copy":160,"asset":161},"Deep blues and exquisite brass work dominate facade and interior detailing.",{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":32,"videoUrl":33,"videoWidth":34,"image":162},{"width":96,"height":163,"url":164,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":165},1354,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731342436-img_7151-1.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":166,"srcSet":167,"src":168,"width":156,"height":169,"sizes":158},"https